{"event_type":"review","id":"1ddd4c5d93c8c3b23bbfe80218d7a87d60c1ee6df3ccd837589aa2e9787716e6","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T18:38:25Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e8e3aa4c80f862b1c4c3ce8dfde7f54c4b4e234a29d7de427836cd49a0dd4b32","sha256":"e8e3aa4c80f862b1c4c3ce8dfde7f54c4b4e234a29d7de427836cd49a0dd4b32"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/14fff7f2de48ce3de5f961a319d4acf964075a4ef216b157970a73b8805e7755","sha256":"14fff7f2de48ce3de5f961a319d4acf964075a4ef216b157970a73b8805e7755"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/72183bbd61e1c4b6621ebe536580912beed4aa3e09f07594839682635da76792","sha256":"72183bbd61e1c4b6621ebe536580912beed4aa3e09f07594839682635da76792"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a71bba6c5586f31546b04a882044552f70a0d8735e9c6545a71b989eeda51c68","sha256":"a71bba6c5586f31546b04a882044552f70a0d8735e9c6545a71b989eeda51c68"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/022610bb7c44dd0907aa2aa0c2942ad137fcb112fccdd2872d38c199e290fa60","sha256":"022610bb7c44dd0907aa2aa0c2942ad137fcb112fccdd2872d38c199e290fa60"}],"attempt_id":"bd92e52642d39ecc87e28ac02440eea4d23a719c24b01054b551940d9fac6468:0:1","base":"e124460382d4d39ff28f6beceb33565a1dfe8470","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6318734bd7fff23a784e0f2c0d7509e3a4b3780c","body":"**Replace `localeCompare` with a locale-independent comparison.**\n\nThe comment on Line 174 promises deterministic output. `localeCompare` without a fixed locale uses the host's default locale and ICU data. Two environments, such as a developer machine and CI, can then order the same `unknown` entries differently. That breaks byte-stable comparison of the importer output.\n\nLine 156 already uses the default code-unit `sort()` for group keys. Use the same ordering here.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  unknown.sort((a, b) => JSON.stringify(a).localeCompare(JSON.stringify(b)));\n+  unknown.sort((a, b) => {\n+    const x = JSON.stringify(a);\n+    const y = JSON.stringify(b);\n+    return x < y ? -1 : x > y ? 1 : 0;\n+  });\n```\n</details>","id":"42a0ef610d88f327ace53c49719f972e8ab3564e0388cd65dfc712daf2334757","intervals":[],"path":"scripts/measurement-acceptance.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Replace `localeCompare` with a locale-independent comparison."}],"head":"0ad07c05f98e9736efdc8be3e60c6017549392ff","head_tree":"93b37a39215e5d93cf94d731cb4d3bbc46fcad60","input_scope":[{"blob":"3aa93fc4e51c0b5e54d12bb1f5c646fbb3b2dfca","intervals":[[1,11]],"path":"scripts/ci-select-checks.d.mts"},{"blob":"29f2d7621023549991db79283dd22bc3d4c442f7","intervals":[[1,59]],"path":"scripts/ci-select-checks.mjs"},{"blob":"f14da2676566f7714e6ab6e0c6f0407c5cda2875","intervals":[[1,31]],"path":"scripts/measurement-acceptance.d.mts"},{"blob":"6318734bd7fff23a784e0f2c0d7509e3a4b3780c","intervals":[[1,177]],"path":"scripts/measurement-acceptance.mjs"}],"job_id":"bd92e52642d39ecc87e28ac02440eea4d23a719c24b01054b551940d9fac6468:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"3aa93fc4e51c0b5e54d12bb1f5c646fbb3b2dfca","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/ci-select-checks.d.mts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"29f2d7621023549991db79283dd22bc3d4c442f7","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/ci-select-checks.mjs","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"f14da2676566f7714e6ab6e0c6f0407c5cda2875","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/measurement-acceptance.d.mts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"m